{"ID":"20240511164711-q0jezeg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511164711-q0jezeg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511164711-q0jezeg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511170903-runnfyu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511170903-runnfyu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:790,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511170903-runnfyu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"001","type":"doc","updated":"20240513090822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511170903-runnfyu","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1122px;","id":"20240511170903-runnfyu","updated":"20240511171529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/03/03"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"249 Y, YS"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"38, 瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/03/03"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小時有氣喘病史"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸膈環繞一圈脹滿，無穿心痛"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→維脈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下硬塊，鼻痰清不出。曾先後服用過小青龍湯，大陷胸湯，半夏厚朴湯。吃完大陷胸湯後氣可從兩邊下去。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-weight: normal;"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問診： \n1、睡眠：好，半夜出冷汗 \n2、胃口：好，不噁心，不會吐\n3、大便：正常。\n4、小便：正常。\n5、口渴：口不渴，口亁但欲漱水不欲咽。 \n6、手足溫度：有時熱有時冷，此時手腳乾燥，手很熱。\n7、生理期：27日一次每次五日\n8、皮膚乾燥，吸氣至胸膈下不去，出汗正常，洗完澡發冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-weight: normal;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：苔淡白紅\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺家寒實兼裡寒"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙腳公孫、左內關、外關、天突、巨闕、中脘、外迎香透內迎香"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右手肝關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對中膈之氣，女人下針下右手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南星三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→除痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢 乾薑二錢 炙甘草二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四逆湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛夷三錢 菖蒲三錢 蒼朮三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治鼻，去濕通竅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代赭石三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→降逆氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9—3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早餐前及睡前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}